        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoshea Last King of Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the twelfth year of Ahaz king of Judah, Hoshea son of Elah became king of Israel in Samaria, and he reigned nine years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He did evil in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but not like the kings of Israel who preceded him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalmaneser king of Assyria came up to attack Hoshea, who had been Shalmaneser's vassal and had paid him tribute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the king of Assyria discovered that Hoshea was a traitor, for he had sent envoys to So",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "king of Egypt, and he no longer paid tribute to the king of Assyria, as he had done year by year. Therefore Shalmaneser seized him and put him in prison.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king of Assyria invaded the entire land, marched against Samaria and laid siege to it for three years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the ninth year of Hoshea, the king of Assyria captured Samaria and deported the Israelites to Assyria. He settled them in Halah, in Gozan on the Habor River and in the towns of the Medes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Israel Exiled Because of Sin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All this took place because the Israelites had sinned against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God, who had brought them up out of Egypt from under the power of Pharaoh king of Egypt. They worshiped other gods",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and followed the practices of the nations the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had driven out before them, as well as the practices that the kings of Israel had introduced.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Israelites secretly did things against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God that were not right. From watchtower to fortified city they built themselves high places in all their towns.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They set up sacred stones and Asherah poles on every high hill and under every spreading tree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At every high place they burned incense, as the nations whom the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had driven out before them had done. They did wicked things that aroused the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They worshiped idols, though the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had said, \"You shall not do this.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "warned Israel and Judah through all his prophets and seers: \"Turn from your evil ways. Observe my commands and decrees, in accordance with the entire Law that I commanded your ancestors to obey and that I delivered to you through my servants the prophets.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they would not listen and were as stiff-necked as their ancestors, who did not trust in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They rejected his decrees and the covenant he had made with their ancestors and the statutes he had warned them to keep. They followed worthless idols and themselves became worthless. They imitated the nations around them although the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had ordered them, \"Do not do as they do.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They forsook all the commands of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God and made for themselves two idols cast in the shape of calves, and an Asherah pole. They bowed down to all the starry hosts, and they worshiped Baal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They sacrificed their sons and daughters in the fire. They practiced divination and sought omens and sold themselves to do evil in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", arousing his anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was very angry with Israel and removed them from his presence. Only the tribe of Judah was left,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and even Judah did not keep the commands of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God. They followed the practices Israel had introduced.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rejected all the people of Israel; he afflicted them and gave them into the hands of plunderers, until he thrust them from his presence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he tore Israel away from the house of David, they made Jeroboam son of Nebat their king. Jeroboam enticed Israel away from following the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and caused them to commit a great sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Israelites persisted in all the sins of Jeroboam and did not turn away from them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "until the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "removed them from his presence, as he had warned through all his servants the prophets. So the people of Israel were taken from their homeland into exile in Assyria, and they are still there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samaria Resettled",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king of Assyria brought people from Babylon, Kuthah, Avva, Hamath and Sepharvaim and settled them in the towns of Samaria to replace the Israelites. They took over Samaria and lived in its towns.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they first lived there, they did not worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; so he sent lions among them and they killed some of the people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was reported to the king of Assyria: \"The people you deported and resettled in the towns of Samaria do not know what the god of that country requires. He has sent lions among them, which are killing them off, because the people do not know what he requires.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the king of Assyria gave this order: \"Have one of the priests you took captive from Samaria go back to live there and teach the people what the god of the land requires.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So one of the priests who had been exiled from Samaria came to live in Bethel and taught them how to worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, each national group made its own gods in the several towns where they settled, and set them up in the shrines the people of Samaria had made at the high places.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people from Babylon made Sukkoth Benoth, those from Kuthah made Nergal, and those from Hamath made Ashima;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Avvites made Nibhaz and Tartak, and the Sepharvites burned their children in the fire as sacrifices to Adrammelek and Anammelek, the gods of Sepharvaim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They worshiped the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but they also appointed all sorts of their own people to officiate for them as priests in the shrines at the high places.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They worshiped the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but they also served their own gods in accordance with the customs of the nations from which they had been brought.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To this day they persist in their former practices. They neither worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nor adhere to the decrees and regulations, the laws and commands that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave the descendants of Jacob, whom he named Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made a covenant with the Israelites, he commanded them: \"Do not worship any other gods or bow down to them, serve them or sacrifice to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", who brought you up out of Egypt with mighty power and outstretched arm, is the one you must worship. To him you shall bow down and to him offer sacrifices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must always be careful to keep the decrees and regulations, the laws and commands he wrote for you. Do not worship other gods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not forget the covenant I have made with you, and do not worship other gods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rather, worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.39"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God; it is he who will deliver you from the hand of all your enemies.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They would not listen, however, but persisted in their former practices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even while these people were worshiping the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.17.41"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", they were serving their idols. To this day their children and grandchildren continue to do as their ancestors did.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
